			"notes": "This is the **first official release** and **biggest content addition** since first published, please report any **bugs** or **problems** you might find to me on **Discord: @ryfles**. Have fun exploring the depths of minecraft :)\n\n### Additions\n- Added the new **Leek** crop with new recipes and a wild crop version\n- Added more spider focussed items (**Spider Stew**, **Spider Silk**\n- Added three types of tea (**Deep Coal Tea**, **Sweet Petal Tea** and **Glow Berry Tea**)\n- Added two new types of wraps\n- Added a recipe to craft one **Spider Silk** into two **Strings**\n- Added a new mob called **Deep Coal Golem** \n  - Drops 2-4 **Deep Coal** and 1 **Moss Carpet**\n  - Can be found in the new structure **Lush Cave Groove**\n  - Can be bred with **Shimmering Mushroom Slice**\n  - Lore: _This creature was once created to help defending the **Ancient Cities**, but due to its lack of fighting spirit, it was later banished from the **Deep Dark** and fled to the **Lush Caves**_\n\n### Changes\n- Overhauled english and german **item names**\n- Changes some **recipes** and **food values**\n- Increased **Deep Coal Ore** spawn rate \n- Spiders now drop **Spider Silk** instead of **Strings**\n- Recolored **Dripstone Salt** texture to match the color of **Dripstones**\n- Changed **Deep Coal** JEI info to because of the new **Deep Coal Golem**\n- Removed the custom sugar texture\n\n_I currently are aware of a problem causing german JEI translations to dont function properly. Already working on a way of fixing this issue!!!_"
